  "prompt": "Inside a cosy, lovingly decorated tree house in the late afternoon, at golden hour. Low sun pours through a big window on one side, washing the room in warm amber light.\n\n The focal point is a child asleep, slumped sideways on a squashy red beanbag. A closed picture book with a bright blue cover rests on their lap. The room is a kid's den: one small wooden chair, a short bookcase crammed with books, a couple of hand-drawn posters pinned to the plank walls, a string of fairy lights along the ceiling beam, and a rug on the floorboards. In one corner, the top of a wooden ladder pokes up through a square hatch in the floor.\n\n Through the window you see a suburban street at sunset: the back of the child's house close by, with a lit kitchen window, a garden fence, and neighbouring rooftops and trees against an orange-pink sky.\n\n The mood is peaceful and nostalgic, a perfect summer afternoon that's drifted into sleep. Sounds: evening birdsong, leaves rustling around the tree house, a far-off lawnmower or kids playing. Music: soft acoustic guitar or a gentle music box, slow and warm.",
